---
interface Props { showSampleOwners?: boolean; connected?: boolean }
const {showSampleOwners=false, connected=false}=Astro.props;
---
  <div id="owner-demo">
    <div class="stats"><div class="card stat"><strong id="pending-count">3</strong>Sample pending</div><div class="card stat"><strong id="approved-count">0</strong>Sample approved</div><div class="card stat"><strong>0</strong>Live codes sent</div></div>
    <div class="portal-grid"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">AUTOMATION</p><h2>You stay in control.</h2><p id="automation-state" role="status">Sample automation is paused.</p><button id="toggle-automation" class="button secondary" type="button">Enable sample automation</button><p class="hint">The live workflow will use owner-defined approval rules. Requests that need judgment go to owners.</p><div class="inset">After approval, timed access instructions can be sent once PIN installation is confirmed. Unverified agents and owner-coordinated visits receive no automatic keybox code.</div><h3>Service connections</h3><p class="muted">{connected ? <>Owner password login · connected<br />Database · connected for accounts, verification and settings<br />Resend · configured for verification and owner emails</> : <>Service status is shown on the signed-in dashboard.</>}<br />Stripe · not connected<br />igloohome Lockbox + Bridge · not connected</p></section>
    <section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">SAMPLE REQUESTS · NOVEMBER 2026</p><h2>Ready for review.</h2><div id="booking-list"></div><p class="status" id="owner-result" role="status"></p></section></div>
    <div class="two-col"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">AVAILABILITY</p><h2>Make room for a visit.</h2><a class="button secondary" href="/owner/availability">Explore sample availability and blocking →</a><p>Sample slots use Eastern Time. Live scheduling will account for daylight saving time and prevent overlapping reservations.</p></section>
    {showSampleOwners && <section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">OWNER ACCOUNTS</p><h2>Shared responsibility.</h2><p>All owners have the same dashboard permissions. These fictional controls do not create logins or send invitations.</p><ul id="owner-list"></ul><button id="add-owner" class="button secondary" type="button">Add sample owner</button><p id="owner-account-result" role="status"></p></section>}</div>
    <div class="two-col"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">CONVERSATIONS</p><h2>Keep the conversation going.</h2><p><strong>Sample visitor:</strong> “Can we ask questions after our visit?”</p><p>In the live workflow, questions, feedback, and owner replies will remain attached to the booking. This example is not saved.</p><button class="button secondary" id="sample-reply" type="button">Add sample reply</button><p id="reply-result" role="status"></p></section><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">ACTIVITY</p><h2>A record of each change.</h2><ol class="log" id="activity-log"><li>Sample workflow opened. Activity here is fictional and clears on reload.</li></ol></section></div>
  </div>
  <script>import '../scripts/owner-demo';</script>
